WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:05.090
A long, long time ago.

00:05.300 --> 00:08.170
A story from about a hundred years ago.

00:08.970 --> 00:13.430
Nadja, guided by destiny, arrived in Italy

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
NAAJA

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
Nadja,

00:18.890 --> 00:21.440
With your eyes

00:18.890 --> 00:21.440
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
Nadja,

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
NAAJA

00:22.690 --> 00:24.940
What do you see?

00:22.690 --> 00:24.940
Nani ga mieru

00:24.980 --> 00:27.860
Shining in the far distance,

00:24.980 --> 00:27.860
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:27.860 --> 00:30.240
The door to the future,

00:27.860 --> 00:30.240
Mirai no tobira

00:31.160 --> 00:34.620
That's what I'm searching for

00:31.160 --> 00:34.620
Sagashite iru

00:34.620 --> 00:41.830
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:42.540 --> 00:46.040
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:42.540 --> 00:46.040
Minna egao de aetara

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:49.420 --> 00:52.630
It could be so much more fun

00:49.420 --> 00:52.630
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

00:52.680 --> 00:56.100
The world is wide, but it's still one

00:52.680 --> 00:56.100
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

00:56.470 --> 00:59.770
I can't see the end of the journey

00:56.470 --> 00:59.770
Tabi no owari wa mienai

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
God is the only one who could possibly know

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:07.020 --> 01:09.150
I will go waving

01:07.020 --> 01:09.150
Te wo furinagara

01:09.230 --> 01:15.910
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:09.230 --> 01:15.910
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:15.950 --> 01:18.660
But I won't look back

01:15.950 --> 01:18.660
Ushiro mukanai

01:18.990 --> 01:23.960
Until the day my dream comes true

01:18.990 --> 01:23.960
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:24.250 --> 01:27.670
Nadja, Your smile

01:24.250 --> 01:27.670
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:27.750 --> 01:31.090
Nadja, gives me courage

01:27.750 --> 01:31.090
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:31.130 --> 01:34.050
Under the blue sky,

01:31.130 --> 01:34.050
Aoi sora no shita de

01:34.180 --> 01:37.010
I will find the place

01:34.180 --> 01:37.010
Ashita no yukue

01:37.300 --> 01:41.230
where my future lies

01:37.300 --> 01:41.230
Mitsukeru kara

01:48.520 --> 01:51.490
Nadja and the others who crossed the Alps safely...

01:51.780 --> 01:55.280
...has come to a place called Lake Como, the most luxurious...

01:55.280 --> 01:59.620
...vacation spot in Italy, where nobles and the wealthy gather.

02:11.400 --> 02:13.400
﻿Good, we got here faster than I thought.

02:13.650 --> 02:15.360
﻿At one point, I wondered what would happen.

02:16.030 --> 02:19.950
﻿But, it's great that we can perform at a grand hotel like this.

02:23.250 --> 02:26.500
﻿There's some time until the party begins...

02:26.500 --> 02:27.870
I guess I'll take a nap.

02:28.130 --> 02:30.880
﻿That's because we've been pushing it since yesterday.

02:30.880 --> 02:33.380
﻿Why don't we rest a little?

02:34.170 --> 02:36.550
﻿Hey, I'm going to go explore around this place a bit.

02:39.100 --> 02:40.510
﻿Do you want to come along, Rita?

02:40.510 --> 02:41.260
﻿How about you, Nadja?

02:41.850 --> 02:45.930
I want to write a letter to the Director of the Applefield Orphanage.

02:46.140 --> 02:47.140
﻿Why don't you two go?

02:47.540 --> 02:48.170
I see!

02:48.520 --> 02:50.150
﻿Well then, let's go, Rita.

02:52.820 --> 02:55.030
﻿Don't get lost now okay!

02:55.360 --> 02:56.190
﻿Okay!

02:59.370 --> 03:01.030
﻿Dear Ms. Appleton...

03:14.960 --> 03:17.510
﻿Ah, we're here, Master Antonio.

03:31.130 --> 03:36.040
I Don't Understand! The Game of Love That Adults Play

03:42.910 --> 03:44.280
﻿Done!

04:14.250 --> 04:15.500
So cute!

04:28.830 --> 04:30.960
﻿That girl... Where have I...

04:38.010 --> 04:40.670
﻿Huh... a lady I have not met before...

04:40.930 --> 04:44.220
﻿...but that classy beauty must come from a very fine family.

05:03.780 --> 05:06.370
﻿They said the post office is inside this hotel, right...

05:06.620 --> 05:08.410
﻿What are you doing?

05:08.990 --> 05:11.500
﻿You're not a guest here, are you?

05:11.710 --> 05:13.670
﻿The guests come through here...

05:13.670 --> 05:15.830
﻿...and you're in the way.

05:15.840 --> 05:17.380
﻿Eh... but I...

05:17.670 --> 05:18.840
﻿...this letter...

05:21.050 --> 05:22.380
﻿Hey, you're in the way!

05:22.720 --> 05:24.630
﻿Oh! I'm sorry!

05:24.890 --> 05:27.760
﻿You're in the way of the guests. Go away now.

05:27.760 --> 05:28.890
﻿I understand!

05:28.890 --> 05:29.850
﻿I'm sorry.

05:35.020 --> 05:36.190
﻿That letter...

05:36.270 --> 05:38.190
﻿Shall I mail it for you?

05:39.860 --> 05:43.070
﻿My, my, you are the daughter of Count Sciavelli...

05:43.280 --> 05:45.860
﻿I would like to send this letter.

05:46.240 --> 05:46.910
﻿Yes, miss.

05:47.160 --> 05:48.370
﻿ I will take care of it.

05:52.660 --> 05:55.170
﻿Did he say that she's the daughter of a noble? How cool!

05:55.460 --> 05:56.710
It's all right now.

05:56.710 --> 05:58.790
﻿I asked them to take care of it.

05:58.790 --> 06:00.130
﻿Thank vou!

06:00.550 --> 06:02.300
﻿The daughter of a count...

06:10.970 --> 06:13.810
﻿My, you've traveled to so many places.

06:13.890 --> 06:14.600
﻿Yes!

06:14.730 --> 06:16.440
﻿After we're, done with today's party...

06:16.560 --> 06:18.350
﻿...we're going to Milan next.

06:18.520 --> 06:21.400
﻿Oh my! My home is in Milan, you know.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.690
﻿Really?

06:22.690 --> 06:24.110
﻿Milan is a great city.

06:24.400 --> 06:26.910
﻿The new and the old blend together...

06:27.110 --> 06:29.450
﻿What a surprise!

06:29.950 --> 06:33.410
﻿I didn't think I would see my little Rosebud in a place like this!

06:34.040 --> 06:35.790
﻿Ah! Leonardo! Thierry!

06:36.370 --> 06:38.790
﻿We really do Bump into each other a lot.

06:38.960 --> 06:41.210
It ﻿means that this is fate!

06:41.500 --> 06:42.670
Right, my little Rosebud?

06:43.210 --> 06:44.340
﻿It's Nadja.

06:47.840 --> 06:50.640
﻿You've got different women again.

06:50.930 --> 06:53.680
﻿Leonardo has girlfriends all over the world.

06:55.140 --> 06:57.060
﻿Enough about that, little Rosebud.

06:57.270 --> 06:58.600
﻿Why are you here?

07:01.230 --> 07:02.690
﻿Why, if it isn't, Julietta!

07:06.280 --> 07:07.320
﻿Julietta!

07:10.870 --> 07:12.030
﻿When did you get here?

07:12.280 --> 07:13.280
﻿In the morning.

07:13.740 --> 07:15.870
﻿With your mother and father?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.160
﻿Yes.

07:17.160 --> 07:19.750
﻿Then, I'll come pay my respects later.

07:20.290 --> 07:23.380
﻿Oh, this is my fiancée..

07:23.590 --> 07:24.920
Lady Julietta Sciavelli.

07:25.300 --> 07:26.970
﻿F-Fiancée?!

07:27.510 --> 07:28.800
﻿Leonardo!

07:28.970 --> 07:30.760
﻿If we don't get on the boat soon..

07:30.800 --> 07:32.720
﻿...we won't get back in time for the party.

07:33.180 --> 07:34.850
﻿Yeah, you're right.

07:35.600 --> 07:39.270
﻿Well then. I'm going to tour the lake with the ladies.

07:39.560 --> 07:40.690
﻿Would you like to come, Julietta?

07:41.020 --> 07:42.650
﻿No thanks, I'm fine thank you.

07:43.020 --> 07:44.900
﻿Okay. Well, see you later.

07:45.900 --> 07:50.150
﻿Eh? Eh? You would leave your fiancée for your girlfriends?

07:50.450 --> 07:51.360
No way...

07:51.370 --> 07:52.820
﻿You don't have to worry.

07:53.080 --> 07:54.810
It's the way it is.

07:54.810 --> 07:55.640
But...

07:55.890 --> 07:56.430
Yes.

07:57.120 --> 07:59.830
﻿Why don't we go have some tea?

07:59.940 --> 08:00.520
All right?

08:07.760 --> 08:08.630
﻿Uh, yes!

08:14.310 --> 08:15.930
At a masquerade ball?

08:15.930 --> 08:17.100
﻿Yes!

08:17.930 --> 08:20.390
﻿Those two prepared a beautiful dress for me, and...

08:21.150 --> 08:22.650
﻿...they really helped me out.

08:24.400 --> 08:25.900
﻿That's just like him.

08:27.030 --> 08:29.360
﻿Wow... this looks so good.

08:29.450 --> 08:32.240
﻿It's a shame to eat something this pretty!

08:33.070 --> 08:33.620
﻿Oh...

08:33.950 --> 08:36.780
If you don't hurry up and eat it, the birds will eat it for you.

08:37.490 --> 08:38.660
﻿I'll help myself then!

08:48.800 --> 08:50.630
﻿My engagement with Leonardo...

08:50.800 --> 08:52.930
﻿...was made soon after I was born.

08:53.090 --> 08:56.680
﻿It's something that was decided by Leonardo's parents and mine.

08:56.970 --> 08:58.430
﻿Soon after you were born?

08:58.680 --> 08:59.770
﻿You mean as a baby?

09:00.230 --> 09:01.680
﻿Yes, that's right.

09:01.810 --> 09:03.140
﻿Since I was a child...

09:03.150 --> 09:07.610
﻿I've been told I was going to be Leonardo's wife...

09:07.860 --> 09:09.940
And, I've always believed in that...

09:11.820 --> 09:13.740
﻿But, he says...

09:17.330 --> 09:19.080
﻿A marriage decided by parents...

09:19.290 --> 09:21.620
...is just to protect their money and family honour, right?

09:21.790 --> 09:22.410
﻿Of course...

09:22.870 --> 09:24.460
﻿I'll marry you.

09:24.580 --> 09:26.710
But, we're still young.

09:27.040 --> 09:29.340
﻿We need to experience many loves while we still can.

09:31.510 --> 09:35.800
﻿That's why, I will be his wife, but not his lover.

09:36.100 --> 09:39.060
﻿Doesn't a lover become a wife?

09:39.470 --> 09:40.310
﻿It should so.

09:40.520 --> 09:44.640
﻿But nobles have their marriage decided by parents or others around them.

09:45.310 --> 09:46.440
﻿I see...

09:46.900 --> 09:49.820
﻿But, even if the marriage is arranged...

09:49.820 --> 09:52.530
﻿...if the two really fall in love...

09:54.110 --> 09:56.240
﻿If that happened, it would be wonderful, right?

09:56.700 --> 10:00.280
But, to him, I'm just a childhood playmate...

10:00.910 --> 10:03.080
I'm just like a sister to him.

10:03.460 --> 10:07.040
﻿Miss Julietta, don't you like Leonardo?

10:13.300 --> 10:14.670
﻿Miss Julietta?

10:16.840 --> 10:17.720
﻿Nadja...

10:18.430 --> 10:21.220
﻿Do you have someone you like?

10:24.520 --> 10:25.520
I can see that you do.

10:26.020 --> 10:27.810
I can't see him very much though.

10:29.400 --> 10:30.940
﻿You are lucky a person.

10:32.230 --> 10:35.030
﻿I want to know what it feels like to have my heart racing like yours.

10:37.870 --> 10:39.240
﻿Nadja!

10:41.040 --> 10:42.990
﻿What are you doing over there?

10:43.330 --> 10:45.290
﻿We've got to get ready soon.

10:45.710 --> 10:48.000
﻿Oh, no! I've got to get back!

10:48.580 --> 10:51.250
﻿I'll look forward to tonight's party.

10:51.420 --> 10:52.840
Thank you. I'll do my best!

10:53.300 --> 10:54.840
﻿Thank you for the tea.

11:03.560 --> 11:06.730
﻿"...if the two really fall in love..."

11:06.730 --> 11:07.890
﻿"...it would be wonderful, right?"

11:08.690 --> 11:11.150
﻿But, it won't be like that.

11:14.740 --> 11:15.990
﻿Pardon me.

11:16.570 --> 11:18.030
﻿Nice to see you again.

11:21.370 --> 11:24.740
I am Antonio Fabiani.

11:24.950 --> 11:26.660
﻿I am Julietta Sciavelli.

11:30.630 --> 11:32.840
﻿You are the daughter of Count Sciavelli.

11:33.050 --> 11:34.590
﻿I'm happy to make your acquaintance.

11:36.380 --> 11:38.340
﻿Are you going to the party tonight?

11:38.490 --> 11:39.070
Yes.

11:39.550 --> 11:41.010
﻿Then I look forward to it.

11:41.600 --> 11:42.970
May I escort you?

11:43.510 --> 11:45.970
﻿But, I am going with my fiance...

11:50.270 --> 11:51.730
﻿Right, Thierry?

11:52.860 --> 11:53.940
﻿Oh, you!

11:55.360 --> 11:56.730
﻿He's come back.

11:56.740 --> 11:59.150
﻿My fiancée. Excuse me.

12:27.140 --> 12:28.930
﻿The daughter of a count and...

12:29.100 --> 12:32.020
﻿...the fiancee of Leonardo Cardinale...

12:33.020 --> 12:36.520
﻿It makes me want to get her even more.

13:11.440 --> 13:14.270
﻿Why, there's no better investment that this!

13:15.270 --> 13:18.570
﻿You'll make a huge amount of money in no time.

13:21.400 --> 13:22.320
﻿Of course...

13:22.740 --> 13:26.990
﻿If I can be a friend to a family as aristocratic as the Lamborchines...

13:27.450 --> 13:29.040
﻿...especially, with your daughter...

13:30.660 --> 13:32.000
﻿Oh...

13:36.590 --> 13:38.210
Ah, ﻿please, excuse me.

13:41.170 --> 13:44.470
﻿Thanks to your help, the project was a great success.

13:44.970 --> 13:46.800
﻿I'll return the money someday with interest...

13:50.850 --> 13:53.100
﻿Ahhh... I'm sorry...

13:53.190 --> 13:55.100
I see an old friend over there...

13:55.560 --> 13:56.600
﻿Let's talk again soon.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.090
Be careful!

14:05.090 --> 14:07.030
I-I'm sorry.

14:07.030 --> 14:08.070
﻿Move, old man.

14:17.330 --> 14:19.130
﻿Leonardo Cardinale...

14:19.840 --> 14:24.470
﻿A spoiled man, born into money with a noble for a fiancée.

14:25.430 --> 14:28.800
﻿If I take just one thing from a lucky man like you...

14:28.800 --> 14:30.810
﻿...you'll be able to replace it quickly, won't you?

14:35.100 --> 14:37.770
﻿Everyone! Are you ready?

14:37.770 --> 14:39.040
﻿Yes, sir!

14:39.040 --> 14:40.730
Let's do it!

14:40.730 --> 14:42.400
﻿Yes, sir!

14:45.070 --> 14:46.650
﻿Leonardo!!!

14:47.890 --> 14:48.800
Hello!

14:49.160 --> 14:51.080
﻿We wondered where you went!

14:51.080 --> 14:52.330
﻿You promised.

14:52.410 --> 14:53.830
﻿You said you'll dance with us.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.080
﻿Yes, yes.

14:55.290 --> 14:56.790
﻿My "White Lily in a Valley".

14:56.790 --> 14:58.750
﻿My "Fragrant Lily of the Valley".

14:58.750 --> 15:00.500
﻿My "Gentian of the Fields".

15:00.500 --> 15:02.500
﻿I'll be partners with all of you.

15:15.040 --> 15:16.680
May I have this dance?

15:17.520 --> 15:18.230
﻿Yes..

15:28.950 --> 15:31.240
﻿So, you are from Venice?

15:31.240 --> 15:34.200
﻿Yes, but I lived mostly overseas.

15:34.660 --> 15:38.870
﻿That's because I have many businesses like trading in French wines and investing.

15:39.080 --> 15:41.130
﻿You must be very busy.

15:41.380 --> 15:42.340
﻿Yes, pretty much.

15:42.630 --> 15:46.420
﻿But, if I marry, I would like to settle down somewhere.

15:46.920 --> 15:49.090
﻿Because I want to put my family first.

15:49.590 --> 15:52.800
﻿The woman who becomes your wife is very lucky.

15:53.180 --> 15:54.220
﻿Is that so.

16:07.070 --> 16:08.110
﻿With him?

16:16.580 --> 16:19.330
﻿Hey, Leonardo... Julietta's partner.

16:19.920 --> 16:21.420
﻿Antonio Fabiani...

16:22.080 --> 16:23.460
﻿You need to be careful with him.

16:23.750 --> 16:25.670
﻿There's a lot of bad rumours about him.

16:27.960 --> 16:30.510
﻿But, Julietta is a smart woman.

16:30.840 --> 16:31.930
﻿I wouldn't worry.

16:33.600 --> 16:35.180
﻿But, it is strange.

16:36.850 --> 16:40.940
﻿How can your fiancée leave you alone?

16:41.810 --> 16:46.070
﻿If I was him, I would only want to look at you.

16:58.450 --> 17:01.080
﻿I'm sorry, I'm a little tired.

17:06.630 --> 17:08.050
﻿I'm not letting you get away.

17:33.280 --> 17:35.030
﻿Don't run away... Julietta!

17:36.450 --> 17:38.080
﻿Ah! Miss Julietta?!

17:39.700 --> 17:41.000
﻿Please let go of me...!

17:41.000 --> 17:41.980
﻿I have...!

17:41.980 --> 17:43.140
I know!

17:43.330 --> 17:45.750
﻿But, from the first moment I saw you...

17:46.130 --> 17:48.000
﻿I knew you were my soul mate.

17:52.630 --> 17:54.050
﻿So, please don't run.

18:12.820 --> 18:13.940
﻿I'll wait.

18:14.200 --> 18:16.200
﻿Someday, your beautiful eyes...

18:16.410 --> 18:18.120
﻿...will look at me.

18:18.200 --> 18:19.410
﻿Until then.

18:25.750 --> 18:26.750
﻿I'll wait!

18:27.040 --> 18:30.340
﻿Someday, your beautiful eyes, will look at me!

18:30.340 --> 18:31.420
﻿Until then!

18:32.010 --> 18:34.130
﻿Why? Why?

18:34.130 --> 18:36.550
﻿Why did I have to hear his words!

18:57.200 --> 18:58.410
﻿You are...!

19:06.870 --> 19:07.960
﻿I remember...

19:08.000 --> 19:10.330
﻿...the one who came to the masquerade in Paris...

19:12.960 --> 19:16.970
﻿That night, you acted like a princess and had fun, didn't you?

19:17.380 --> 19:20.640
﻿The appearance of the real Black Rose was unexpected, however.

19:21.430 --> 19:23.010
﻿What did you do to Miss Julietta?

19:23.470 --> 19:25.980
﻿She's Leonardo's fiancée, you know!

19:25.980 --> 19:27.350
﻿What you just saw...

19:27.520 --> 19:29.730
﻿..don't tell Leonardo and the others.

19:30.020 --> 19:32.770
﻿It's a common thing in the world of nobles and adults.

19:33.020 --> 19:35.360
It ﻿has nothing to do with a dancer like you.

19:35.490 --> 19:36.860
﻿Here! Take this.

19:38.990 --> 19:41.740
﻿Buy a dress or whatever you want.

19:41.870 --> 19:43.450
﻿I don't want your money

19:45.000 --> 19:45.870
﻿What are you doing?!

19:46.080 --> 19:48.960
﻿I don't need your money, and I won't tell...

19:49.210 --> 19:50.250
﻿But, this isn't right!

19:50.460 --> 19:52.840
﻿What you're doing... I don't understand it!

19:57.220 --> 19:59.220
﻿A child wouldn't understand.

20:02.100 --> 20:03.430
﻿What is with him!

20:03.560 --> 20:05.430
Nadja... your face is scary.

20:06.350 --> 20:09.350
﻿Do you mean to go on stage with that scary face?

20:13.360 --> 20:14.230
That's right.﻿

20:14.230 --> 20:16.070
﻿A dance should be done with happy feelings.

20:16.610 --> 20:17.400
﻿Okay!

20:17.820 --> 20:20.530
﻿Next is, the pride of the Dandelion Troupe!

20:20.530 --> 20:22.320
﻿The miraculous dancing princess, Nadja...

20:22.320 --> 20:25.950
﻿...and the samurai, Kennosuke's, Italian flag show!

21:23.030 --> 21:25.570
Early the next morning, Nadja and the troupe...

21:25.570 --> 21:27.990
...started for Milan.

21:47.030 --> 21:48.330
﻿What a beautiful lady...

21:52.810 --> 21:55.560
Was it the whimsy of the goddess of fate?

21:56.020 --> 22:02.950
Nadja did not even dream that the lady was he mother, Colette.

22:15.370 --> 22:18.620
Paris is sunnier than London

22:15.370 --> 22:18.620
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:22.250 --> 22:28.420
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:22.250 --> 22:28.420
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
Indeed

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
Kitto

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
It's not use worrying about it

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:36.380 --> 22:39.510
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:36.380 --> 22:39.510
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:39.770 --> 22:44.480
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:39.770 --> 22:44.480
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
To be, to be

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
Naru naru

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
The tree fog won

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
The world frog-jumping contest

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Under the kitten's paw

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Is the scent of the sun, right?

